<!--
    plans/plan_xnapipeline_parity.md XNAPP-260: a game-defined type supplied as XNA-style
    intermediate XML. Nothing in CNA knows what a QuestBook is; the document names it, the game's
    own DescribeContent says what its members are, and the game's own ContentTypeWriter turns it
    into an .xnb. Reusable is left out so an omitted optional member keeps its C++ default.
-->
<XnaContent xmlns:Quest="QuestGame">
